B.akG=new A.aN('The MLBB X Ducati Collaboration event has arrived! The brand new collaboration skins: Irithel "Monster SP Rider" and Benedetta "Panigale V4S Rider" are available for a limited time!\n\n1. The first 1x Draw every day and the first 10x Draw of the event will be 50% OFF.\n\n2. A random Epic or better skin is guaranteed in the first 10 draws.\n\n3. An Epic or a better skin is guaranteed every 10 draws. You\'ll also light up 1 random Bingo piece on the Bingo board.\n\n4. Light up 3 Bingo pieces in a row, column, or diagonal on the Bingo board to complete the Bingo for an unowned Epic or better skin (prioritizes MLBB X Ducati Collaboration Skins). Only 1 skin can be obtained each time you complete the Bingo.\n\n5. After the Bingo is completed, extra Bingo pieces lit will disappear, but will each provide an extra 10% discount for the next 10x Draw. The discount only takes effect until the next Bingo completion. When both the Bingo and First 10x Draw discounts are available, only the First 10x Draw discount will take effect.\n\n6. You can claim total draw rewards via the Draw Rewards button on the event page once you make the specified numbers of draws.\n\n7. Duplicate skins will be converted into Ducati Token Fragments. Ducati Token Fragments will automatically be converted into Ducati Tokens. Each unused Ducati Token will be converted into 3 Rare Skin Fragments at the end of the event. And each unused Ducati Token Fragment will be converted into 100 Battle Points.\n\n8. Every 30 Ducati Token Fragments you receive will automatically be converted into 1 Ducati Token.\nDuplicate Rewards Conversion Rates:\na. MLBB X Ducati Collaboration Skin: 267 Ducati Token Fragments\nb. Exclusive Epic Skin: 53 Ducati Token Fragments\nc. Epic Skin: 24 Ducati Token Fragments\nd. Special Skin: 20 Ducati Token Fragments\ne. Elite Skin: 16 Ducati Token Fragments\nf. Basic Skin: 7 Ducati Token Fragments\ng. Battle Emote: 2 Ducati Token Fragments\n\n9. Drop Rates (Single Draw):\na. MLBB X Ducati Collaboration Skin (0.003%)\nb. Epic & Exclusive Epic Skin (3.25%)\nSpecial Skin (3%)\nElite Skin (10%)\nBasic Skin (20.747%)\nBattle Emote (16%)\nOther (47%)',null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.afG=new A.il(B.akG,null)
