B.aky=new A.aN('From 11/7 to 11/24, the new Double 11 event skin, Wanwan "Flying Swallow", and other exclusive skins from previous Double 11 events, including Gusion "Dimension Walker", Hayabusa "Shura", and X.Borg "Tesla Maniac" will be available for a limited time.\n\n1. During the event, participate in the Veiled Sky Wish Draw for a chance of winning Double 11 Exclusive Skins, Collector Skins, Exclusive Epic Skins, Epic Skins, Special Skins, Elite Skins, and Basic Skins, as well as rare Battle Emotes and Items.\n\n2. From 11/9 00:00 - 11/14 24:00, Promo Diamonds can be used to draw in the event. Rules for using Promo Diamonds are as follows:\na) Promo Diamonds can only be used for 1X draws, and cannot be used with the 50% Off discount or Draw Tokens.\nb) You can use up to 80 Promo Diamonds in one 1X draw. The maximum amount of Promo Diamonds will be used each time. You cannot change how many Promo Diamonds to use.\nc) A check box option to use Promo Diamonds will appear from 11/9 00:00 - 11/14 24:00. This option will revert to unchecked every day at 00:00. Remember to check it again to use Promo Diamonds.\nd) If you want to use Draw Tokens for 1X draw, please uncheck the use Promo Diamonds option.\n\n3. One Special Skin or better is guaranteed in the first 10 draws.\n\n4. At least 1 Elite Skin or better is guaranteed in every 10 draws afterward.\n\n5. Enjoy 50% Off on your first 10X draw of the event, and 50% Off on your first 1X draw every day.\n\n6. Draw Rewards can be claimed when reaching 15, 20, 30, 40, and 50 draws.\n\n7. Each draw has a chance to add 5-15 to your Wish Score, and a very small chance to add 1000 to your Wish Score. When your Wish Score reaches 200, 300, 400, 500, and 1000, you can open the corresponding Wish Box for skin rewards.\n\n8. Wish Score can be accumulated. The Wish Box will upgrade after reaching a certain Wish Score and will have better skin rewards.\n\n9. Opening the Wish Box will consume the Wish Score. Upgrade it to the Mythic Wish Box before opening to get a guaranteed Exclusive Epic or better skin!\n\n10. Swallow Crests can be exchanged for skins in the Event Shop. You can also exchange for skins to gift to friends. Please note that you must own the skin first before you can buy or exchange another to gift.\n\n11. Veiled Sky Wish Tokens and 50% Off discounts can not be used together.\n\n12. Tap Prize Pool to view all rewards.\n\n13. Duplicate Skins and Battle Emotes obtained in the event will be automatically converted into the corresponding amount of Swallow Crests:\nDouble 11 Exclusive Skin, Collector Skin, Exclusive Epic Skin: 200\nEpic Skin: 80\nSpecial Skin: 50\nElite Skin: 20\nBasic Skin: 10\nBattle Emote: 3\n\n14. After the event ends, any remaining event items (including Veiled Sky Wish Tokens and Swallow Crests) will be removed.\n\nDrop Rates:\nDouble 11 Exclusive Skin, Collector Skin, Exclusive Epic Skin (0.03%)\nEpic Skin (0.11%)\nSpecial Skin (1.36%)\nElite Skin (9.04%)\nBasic Skin (9.05%)\nItem (59.59%)\nSwallow Crest (20.82%)\n\nWish Box Drop Rates:\nCommon Wish Box: Elite Skin (50%), Basic Skin (50%)\nRare Wish Box: Special Skin (50%), Elite Skin (50%)\nEpic Wish Box: Epic Skin (5%), Special Skin (95%)\nLegendary Wish Box: Double 11 Exclusive Skin or Exclusive Epic Skin (3%), Epic Skin (97%)\nMythic Wish Box: Double 11 Exclusive Skin, Collector Skin or Exclusive Epic Skin (100%)',null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.afL=new A.il(B.aky,null)
B.akq=new A.aN('Abyssal Wings assemble! The Following Abyss Series skins: Moskov "Doom Incarnate", Alpha "General Void", Selena "Lady Vengeance", and Leomord "Shadow Knight" are back for a limited time!\n\n1. During this event, you can draw for event badges and permanent exclusive rewards from the event prize pool (Exclusive Skin, Elimination Effect, Spawn Effect, Battle Emote, Avatar Border, and Sacred Statue).\nDrop Rates:\nPermanent Exclusive Rewards (9.94%)\nEvent Badges (90.06%)\n\n2. The first 1x draw of each day will be 50% off.\n\n3. A permanent reward from the prize pool is guaranteed in your first 10 draws (only once per event).\nDrop Rates for this one-time reward:\nExclusive Skin (0.1%)\nAvatar Border (30%)\nElimination Effect (10%)\nSpawn Effect (40%)\nSacred Statue (10%)\nBattle Emote (9.9%)\n\n4. Tap "Daily Surprise" to get a random reward once a day.\n\n5. You can exchange event badges in the Event Shop for the rewards in the prize pool. The Recall Effect can only be obtained from the Event Shop.\n\n6. The event exclusive skins can be obtained from the Event Shop or gifted by friends. Players who are Lv.20 or higher and have been friends for over 7 days can gift skins to each other (you must own a skin first in order to exchange for another copy to gift).\n\n7. Duplicated rewards obtained in this event will be automatically converted to a corresponding amount of event badges:\nPermanent Skin: 510\nPermanent Elimination Effect: 45\nPermanent Spawn Effect: 45\nPermanent Avatar Border: 30\nPermanent Sacred Statue: 16\nPermanent Battle Emote: 10\n\n8. At the end of the event, all unused badges and tokens will be removed. Please use your items in time.',null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
